  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-8">
      Automated node management, from launch to maintenance
    </h2>
    <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Snowside is born from <strong>NodΞRunr</strong>, the lightweight daemon that won a retro9000
      grant from the Avalanche Foundation for simplifying Layer‑1 operations. NodΞRunr handles
      one‑click deployment, custom precompile integration, 24/7 monitoring, and automatic updates.
    </p>
    <!-- Image placeholder: NodΞRunr dashboard / terminal launch -->
    <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-snow-300 bg-surface-1 p-12 max-w-md mx-auto">
      <p class="text-sm font-mono text-slate-500 text-center">
        NodΞRunr Dashboard<br />
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-600">(image placeholder)</span>
